        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "63e5a9ef-aa7f-3963-9c67-fdcfee98293b",
                "word": "indéchiffrable",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "8a4c6a97-a14a-476e-a388-63d1aadd46e8",
                        "entry_id": "63e5a9ef-aa7f-3963-9c67-fdcfee98293b",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "indéchiffrables"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bc7969e7-fdbc-3394-9c54-5965a80da01e",
                        "entry_id": "63e5a9ef-aa7f-3963-9c67-fdcfee98293b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui ne peut se déchiffrer."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2df63498-ced2-4fb0-9dbb-6fae2c0b1675",
                                "sense_id": "bc7969e7-fdbc-3394-9c54-5965a80da01e",
                                "text": "Dans un des îlots du Morbihan, celui de Gavr’inis (île de la Chèvre), il y a une tombelle plus étrange encore : elle a 8 mètres de haut sur 100 mètres de circonférence ; à l'intérieur, elle recèle une grotte aux parois couvertes d’hiéroglyphes indéchiffrables et de sculptures impossibles à décrire."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "01895d76-d340-4ac4-b1a1-2771a0ff1ea3",
                                "sense_id": "bc7969e7-fdbc-3394-9c54-5965a80da01e",
                                "text": "Non seulement les codes d'aujourd'hui sont, de fait, indéchiffrables, mais le problème de distribution des clefs a été résolu. Selon Philip Zimmermann, nous vivons un âge d'or de la cryptographie : « Avec les moyens modernes, on peut coder en restant réellement hors de portée de toute forme connue de cryptanalyse. […]. »"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e5032ace-f4d6-4892-84f1-daa537242a00",
                                "sense_id": "bc7969e7-fdbc-3394-9c54-5965a80da01e",
                                "text": "Le caractère de cet homme est indéchiffrable."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8f41b42e-2f08-3977-b26a-2302e2a640b9",
                        "entry_id": "63e5a9ef-aa7f-3963-9c67-fdcfee98293b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui est difficile à lire."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ad4a527c-63ca-402a-ac3e-2f4203845176",
                                "sense_id": "8f41b42e-2f08-3977-b26a-2302e2a640b9",
                                "text": "Ces illustres paperasses, dont l’écriture gothiquement indéchiffrable eût demandé des lunettes et la science d’un bénédictin, étaient enveloppées pieusement d’un morceau de taffetas cramoisi dont la couleur passée avait pris une teinte pisseuse."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d50e5470-b12c-4c2f-a92d-8c49cc648917",
                                "sense_id": "8f41b42e-2f08-3977-b26a-2302e2a640b9",
                                "text": "Il les récita d'une haleine, sans en omettre un seul mot, tandis que Guilleragues en écrivait les parties essentielles sous sa dictée, en une forme abrégée et indéchiffrable."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "21609e7b-8b73-3104-842b-d83d3094c894",
                        "entry_id": "63e5a9ef-aa7f-3963-9c67-fdcfee98293b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui est obscur, embrouillé, qu’on ne peut expliquer."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e8607f33-2af2-46ef-ba1b-f62768648aff",
                                "sense_id": "21609e7b-8b73-3104-842b-d83d3094c894",
                                "text": "Toujours en représentation, parlant beaucoup et ne se livrant pas, lisible mais indéchiffrable !"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "057a4ece-8cdd-4e5d-8aa2-efdb0f22d38c",
                                "sense_id": "21609e7b-8b73-3104-842b-d83d3094c894",
                                "text": "L’énigme semblait indéchiffrable. Les gens de Cornabeuf, sentant peser sur eux l’horreur de ce mystère, se barricadaient le soir dans leurs maisons."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0bf8d598-7644-41e8-8c7f-efa5e51362d4",
                        "source_entry_id": "63e5a9ef-aa7f-3963-9c67-fdcfee98293b",
                        "target_lang_word": "indecipherable",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "indecipherable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f024b731-e917-3972-8147-2b1ab72bba2c",
                                        "entry_id": "3f46d829-1213-3811-87b3-25170fa416e7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not decipherable; impossible to decode, read, understand or comprehend."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "09c498d1-9997-4c14-aeab-f0c2be509283",
                                                "sense_id": "f024b731-e917-3972-8147-2b1ab72bba2c",
                                                "text": "The doctor's handwriting was indecipherable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56b99ba6-b1af-47ff-b57e-9243e348df48",
                                                "sense_id": "f024b731-e917-3972-8147-2b1ab72bba2c",
                                                "text": "The second and third quarters of the shield are indecipherable on the stone but clearer in two other representations of the arms, a painted wooden funeral hatchment for Mary Davie[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5006f5fb-5360-464f-a1ad-48d89fe64a74",
                                                "sense_id": "f024b731-e917-3972-8147-2b1ab72bba2c",
                                                "text": "One of the last remaining members of the Navajo Code Talkers, who used their difficult-to-learn language to form an indecipherable code that helped the Allies win World War II, has died."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f035e9e5-cb2a-38bc-ba99-bd51ba2bb839",
                                        "entry_id": "3f46d829-1213-3811-87b3-25170fa416e7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Indistinguishable"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99aa30c7-8bac-42c2-8594-1173e8e39ace",
                                                "sense_id": "f035e9e5-cb2a-38bc-ba99-bd51ba2bb839",
                                                "text": "The explanation some are suggesting is that the object takes on the appearance of what is behind it, or that it takes on the appearanec ^([sic]) of what the observer thinks is behind it. In both cases, the object is still visible. It's a visible representation of what's behind it, but it is still invisible, just indecipherable from its surroundings."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e9741f1-fff5-46b5-aea6-0cc43649b550",
                                                "sense_id": "f035e9e5-cb2a-38bc-ba99-bd51ba2bb839",
                                                "text": "If you knew who Jerry was you'd swear you'd been cloned. Your posting style is virtually indecipherable from his."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1a57b0c-5936-4a8c-8f93-776d85af8bc1",
                                                "sense_id": "f035e9e5-cb2a-38bc-ba99-bd51ba2bb839",
                                                "text": "A British university compared lads' mags with comments from convicted rapists. It found that people could not distinguish the source of the comments. That is, Zoo uses language practically indecipherable from that of sex offenders."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "589e753f-852b-4281-b9ae-2a340fff3373",
                        "source_entry_id": "63e5a9ef-aa7f-3963-9c67-fdcfee98293b",
